 1. Which extension changed your day-to-day typing/editing experience the most?
Prettier helped me the most because it automatically formatted my code. It saved time and made my code look neat.

2. Which extension is about the code itself vs. collaboration/history?
Python, Java, and Prettier help with writing and formatting code. GitLens is for code history, and Live Share is for working with others.

3. Which extension would you keep enabled for every project?
I would keep Prettier and GitLens enabled for every project. I would use the Python and Java extensions only when needed.

4. How did Live Share change pair programming compared to screen sharing?
Live Share was more interactive because both people could edit the same code at the same time instead of one person only watching.